    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "2TI",
      "chapter": 3,
      "chapter_usfm": "2TI.3",
      "version_id": 68,
      "version_abbr": "GNT",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Remember that there will be difficult times in the last days."
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "People will be selfish, greedy, boastful, and conceited; they will be insulting, disobedient to their parents, ungrateful, and irreligious;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "they will be unkind, merciless, slanderers, violent, and fierce; they will hate the good;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "they will be treacherous, reckless, and swollen with pride; they will love pleasure rather than God;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "they will hold to the outward form of our religion, but reject its real power. Keep away from such people."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Some of them go into people's houses and gain control over weak women who are burdened by the guilt of their sins and driven by all kinds of desires,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "women who are always trying to learn but who can never come to know the truth."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "As Jannes and Jambres were opposed to Moses, so also these people are opposed to the truth—people whose minds do not function and who are failures in the faith."
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But they will not get very far, because everyone will see how stupid they are. That is just what happened to Jannes and Jambres."
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But you have followed my teaching, my conduct, and my purpose in life; you have observed my faith, my patience, my love, my endurance,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "my persecutions, and my sufferings. You know all that happened to me in Antioch, Iconium, and Lystra, the terrible persecutions I endured! But the Lord rescued me from them all."
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.12",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Everyone who wants to live a godly life in union with Christ Jesus will be persecuted;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.13",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and evil persons and impostors will keep on going from bad to worse, deceiving others and being deceived themselves."
        },
        {
          "verse": 14,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.14",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But as for you, continue in the truths that you were taught and firmly believe. You know who your teachers were,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 15,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.15",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and you remember that ever since you were a child, you have known the Holy Scriptures, which are able to give you the wisdom that leads to salvation through faith in Christ Jesus."
        },
        {
          "verse": 16,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.16",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "All Scripture is inspired by God and is useful for teaching the truth, rebuking error, correcting faults, and giving instruction for right living,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 17,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.17",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "so that the person who serves God may be fully qualified and equipped to do every kind of good deed."
        }
      ],
      "verse_count": 17,
      "headings": [
        {
          "before_verse": 10,
          "text": "Last Instructions"
        }
      ],
